sequenceDiagram
    participant VP as VideoPipeline
    participant P as FramePacket
    participant R as ResizeStage
    participant Y as YoloDetectionStage
    participant TS as RDDTrackerStage
    participant T as RDDTracker
    participant D as DrawDetectionsStage

    Note over VP,P: На входе packet содержит сырое изображение frame

    VP->>R: __call__(packet)
    R->>P: resized_frame = resize(frame)
    R-->>VP: packet

    VP->>Y: __call__(packet)
    Y->>P: image = resized_frame или frame
    Y->>P: detections = detector.detect(image, conf)
    Y-->>VP: packet

    VP->>TS: __call__(packet)
    TS->>P: читает frame / resized_frame, detections, frame_id
    TS->>T: update(frame, detections, frame_id)
    T-->>TS: tracked_detections, active_tracks, shift
    TS->>P: detections = tracked_detections
    TS->>P: tracks = active_tracks
    TS->>P: motion = {dx, dy, ok, ...}
    TS-->>VP: packet

    VP->>D: __call__(packet)
    D->>P: image = resized_frame или frame
    D->>P: читает detections (в т.ч. track_id)
    D->>P: annotated_frame = draw(image, detections)
    D-->>VP: packet